{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Utopia is here. You're not impressed.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future? No Thanks! is a narrative-driven, open-world adventure set in an ecosocialist utopia. The year is 2045, and society has never been better: climate change is finally being tackled, democracy thrives, and technology serves humanity rather than enslaving it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's just one problem: you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Harvey Huffstone, a grumpy elder who no longer fits in, and today is the last day of your life. Your final mission? Completing your bucket list before your self-scheduled euthanasia. Indulge in outdated pleasures, explore a post-post-industrial Midwest, clash with a society that's moved on without you, and maybe, just maybe, leave with fewer regrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced and fully acted!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world freedom meets classic point-and-click humor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artisanally made, with locally sourced talent and no capitalist overlords!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of entertainment for leftists (and right-wingers too dumb to get it)!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861870?t=1753799438","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861870?t=1753799438","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861870/4b979b77228048191e348782ed903a68e3d5d713/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753799438","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861870/4b979b77228048191e348782ed903a68e3d5d713/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753799438","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"descrip